.TH HERE 10 "October 2026" "1.1" "Neverdark Manual"
.SH NAME
here \- Show the region you are standing in
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B here
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Print the region you are standing in as a region header: its id, width,
world number, owner, and loaded module count. That is the deepest region the
engine knows about there \- a claimed world, a granted district, or the
cosmos from the void \- and it is the region every region\-scoped command
acts on when you name no region and have set no default target.
.PP
A player standing nowhere is told they are nowhere.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR target,planets,planet,grant,modlist (10)
.SH AUTHOR
quirinpa <quirinpa@tty.pt>
